## 6. Runtime Ownership (Phase 8)

| Object | Creator | Owner | Consumer path |
|---|---|---|---|
| Server RuntimeState | `runtime/bootstrap.lua` | `runtime/bootstrap.lua` | closure → SDK snapshot/IsReady |
| Server Registry | `runtime/bootstrap.lua` | `runtime/bootstrap.lua` | closure → `SDK:RegisterService/GetService` |
| Server EventBus | `runtime/bootstrap.lua` | `runtime/bootstrap.lua` | closure → `SDK:On/Emit` |
| Server Scheduler | `runtime/bootstrap.lua` | `runtime/bootstrap.lua` | closure → `SDK:Schedule` |
| Server PluginManager | `runtime/bootstrap.lua` | `runtime/bootstrap.lua` | closure → `SDK:RegisterPlugin` |
| Server ConfigManager | `runtime/bootstrap.lua` | `runtime/bootstrap.lua` | closure → `SDK:GetConfig` |
| Server SDK | `runtime/bootstrap.lua` | `runtime/bootstrap.lua` | `exports['dce-core']:GetDCEAPI()` |
| Exports | `init.lua` (static) | dce-core | FiveM export resolution |
| Client runtime state/registry/eventbus | `client/bootstrap.lua` | `client/bootstrap.lua` | closure → client SDK facade |
| Client exports | `client/init.lua` (static) | dce-core | FiveM client export resolution |

- One creator, one owner, one destruction path, one consumer path for every object.
- `DCE_INTERNAL` is a server-only (or client-only) namespace populated only by manifest-ordered scripts; it is never published to `_G` and never exposed via exports.

